---
title: Notes from Kibera
publishedDate: 2026-06-10
author: Jane Mwende
excerpt: What we learned documenting daily life in one of Africa's most densely populated informal settlements.
coverImage: civic-education.jpg
---

Our work began with listening. Before a single library went out, we spent months in Kibera documenting daily life — the struggles and the strengths of a community that has never lacked for resilience.

What we found made one thing undeniable: books, knowledge, and civic empowerment are not luxuries for children in informal settlements. They are necessities.
